                <pb facs="1092" n="982" sameAs="frus:frus1928v03/pg982"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.48 Refugees 67/11: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-01-29T15:00:00+02:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 29,
                                1928—3 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received January 29—1:30
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>7. Turkish press today announced that one year’s delay would be accorded by the
                    Government for the stay of the Russian refugees in Turkey.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
